       EEIINNVVAALL The vector count, _i_o_v_c_n_t, is less than zero or greater than  the
              permitted  maximum.  If RRWWFF__AATTOOMMIICC is specified, this maximum is
              given by the _s_t_x___a_t_o_m_i_c___w_r_i_t_e___s_e_g_m_e_n_t_s___m_a_x value from _s_t_a_t_x_.

